course: dictionary
lesson: 7254
title: Pig: one word, two meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A word can have more than one meaning, and the words around it show you which one the writer means. The word pig is a good example. Read the sentence and look for clues.
explain: On a farm, a pig is an animal with a pink or dark body, a flat nose called a snout, short legs and a curly tail. It says «oink». When someone calls a person a pig, it is rude and means they eat too much, are messy or are greedy.
explain: Use the swap test. Put your meaning into the sentence and see if it still makes sense. A pig in a field fits the animal meaning. A pig at the dinner table who takes the last biscuit fits the rude meaning. Ask yourself: is this about a real animal, or about a person's behaviour?
fact: A pig is a farm animal. A mother pig is a sow, a father is a boar, and a baby is a piglet.
fact: Pigs live in a pigsty or pen. Farms give us pork, bacon and ham from pigs.
fact: «When pigs fly» means never, because pigs cannot fly. Alice uses the idea in her story: «Just about as much right as pigs have to fly.»
fact: A guinea pig is not a pig. It is a different animal, so the name is a little misleading.
fact: A piggy bank is a money box, often shaped like a pig, where people save coins.
exercise: «The pig rolled in the mud and went oink.» What kind of pig is this? | A pig's curly tail only | A piggy bank | A rude person who eats too much | *A farm animal that says oink
exercise: Nadia says, «Stop being such a pig, you ate all the cake!» What does pig mean here? | A type of bacon | *A person who is greedy | A baby animal | A pen on a farm
exercise: Which word is the name for a baby pig? | pork | boar | *piglet | sow
test: What is a mother pig called? | bacon | boar | *sow | piglet
test: Which phrase means never? | pigsty | piggy bank | *when pigs fly | guinea pig
exam: Read this: «People in the Andes tamed guinea pigs thousands of years ago.» Why is a guinea pig not a pig? | It is a pig that cannot say oink | It is a baby pig | *It is a different animal | It is a pig with a funny name
